      <ArticleTitle>Synthetic trial of creatine supplementation and memory in older adults.</ArticleTitle>
      <Abstract>
        <AbstractText Label="METHODS">Synthetic record. In this randomized, double-blind trial, 60 older adults took creatine monohydrate 5 g daily or placebo for 12 weeks.</AbstractText>
        <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Synthetic delayed recall improved more with creatine than with placebo. Synthetic grip strength did not differ between groups.</AbstractText>
      </Abstract>
