      <ArticleTitle>Synthetic trial of creatine supplementation and working memory in young adults.</ArticleTitle>
      <Abstract>
        <AbstractText Label="METHODS">Synthetic record. Forty young adults were randomized to creatine 20 g daily or placebo for one week.</AbstractText>
        <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Synthetic working memory scores did not differ between groups. Synthetic reaction times did not differ between groups.</AbstractText>
