      <ArticleTitle>Synthetic trial of creatine supplementation and attention in vegetarians.</ArticleTitle>
      <Abstract>
        <AbstractText Label="METHODS">Synthetic record. In this randomized trial, 50 vegetarian adults took creatine 5 g daily or placebo for six weeks.</AbstractText>
        <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Synthetic sustained attention improved with creatine compared with placebo. Synthetic word-list recall did not differ between groups.</AbstractText>
      </Abstract>
