      <ArticleTitle>Synthetic survey of creatine supplement use and attention.</ArticleTitle>
      <Abstract>
        <AbstractText Label="METHODS">Synthetic record. This cross-sectional survey asked 800 adults about creatine supplement use and tested their attention and processing speed.</AbstractText>
        <AbstractText Label="RESULTS">Synthetic attention scores were not associated with creatine supplement use. Synthetic processing speed was not associated with creatine supplement use.</AbstractText>
